  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HP-Empowerment of children and young adults in Qinghai, China</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For children empowerment will be sought through the International Children Development Programme (ICDP) which aims to equip caregivers in the children&#x2019;s homes and parents with empathetic caring and communication skills, in order to encourage better physical, psychological, social and spiritual development for the children.</narrative>
